cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite it as below."
title: "materials-spine: experimental design on measured materials tables, with an audit trail"
abstract: >-
  A metered screening campaign over real measured tables, engineering laws tested
  against permuted and shuffle controls, and a reaction-network reduction gate
  whose blindness is measured across observation windows. Every reported number
  is a row on an append-only hash chain that names the digest of the table it came
  from.
authors:
